  "details": "When manually entering an Avatar ID into the Pipeline Manager, any blank characters like spaces do not get trimmed.\n\nThis results in `\"malformed url\"` and `NullReferenceException` errors in the console\n\nTo reproduce:\n\nEnter an Avatar ID into the Pipeline Manager\n\nAdd a whitespace character before or after the ID\n\nView the avatar in the SDK Builder to trigger the error.",
